  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The strength of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>50</mn></math>&nbsp;volume solution of hydrogen peroxide is _____&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>/</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></math> (Nearest integer).</p><p>Given:<br />Molar mass of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>34</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math><br />Molar volume of gas at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>STP</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>22</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></math>.</p>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "150",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Molarity&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>Volume</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>strength</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>of</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>Molar</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>volume</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>of</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>oxygen</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>gas</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>at</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>STP</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Molarity <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>50</mn><mrow><mn>11</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>35</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>The strength of the solution<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>Molarity</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>Molecular</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>weight</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>of</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> Strength in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>gm</mi><mo>/</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>50</mn><mrow><mn>11</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>35</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>34</mn></math>.</p>"
